@Test @TC5
    Scenario: Navigate to a facility with an allocated borrower
        When User navigates to a facility with an allocated borrower "Borrower Z"
        And Facility amount is $1000000
        Then The facility view shows "Borrower Z" allocated.
        Then An editable "Limit" field is available for "Borrower Z"
        When User enters valid amount $500000 in the "Limit" field for "Borrower Z"
        Then The value "500000" is accepted into the input field
        And No validation errors appear.
        When User save the facility changes
        Then The changes are saved successfully
        When User navigate away from facility and then back to it
        Then The "Limit" field for "Borrower Z" correctly displays the saved value of "500000"


@Test @TC9
    Scenario: Navigate to a deal with defined primary borrower
       When User navigates to a deal with defined primary borrower
       Then Deal Primary Borrower becomes "DealPrime" and Deal Additional Borrower becomes "DealSecond"
       Then The deal overview page correctly shows "DealPrime" as the primary borrower fir the entire deal
       When User select "Facility J" and allocate both borrowers
       Then "DealPrime" is default primary for "Facility J" 
       When User changes the primary borrower for "Facility J" to "DealSecond"
       Then New Facility Primary becomes "DealSecond"
       Then On "Facility J" screen, "DealSecond" is now shown as the primary borrower
       When User save the facility changes
       Then The changes are saved successfully
       When User navigate back to main deal overview page 
       Then The deal overview page shows "DealPrime" as the primary borrower for the deal
       And The Changes made at the facility level did not propagate to the deal level    



@Test @TC10
    Scenario: Navigate to deal with one borrower and two facilities
       When User navigates to deal with one borrower and two facilities
       Then Borrower becomes "Universal Borrower" with Facilities "Facility X" having amount $500k and "Facility Y" having amount $2M
       Then The deal page is loaded
       When user selects "Facility X" and allocates it as "Universal Borrower"
       Then "Universal Borrower" is successfully allocated to "Facility X"
       When User set the limit for "Universal Borrower" for "Facility X" as $300000
       Then The limit is set to $300000 for "Universal Borrower" in "Facility X"
       And Changes are saved
       When User navigates to "Facility Y"
       Then The "Facility Y" details are displayed "Universal Borrower" is not yet allocated
       When User allocates "Universal Borrower" to "Facility y"
       Then "Universal Borrower" is successfully allocated to "Facility Y"
       And The limit field for this borrower is empty or zero
       When User set the limit as $1000000 for "Universal Borrower" in "Facility Y"
       Then The limit is set to $1000000 for "Universal Borrower" in "Facility Y"
       And Changes are saved
       When User navigates back to "Facility X" 
       Then The view for "Facility X" is displayed 
       And The limit for "Universal Borrower" is shown as $300000



    @Test @TC11
    Scenario: Navigate to facility with several allocated borrowers
       When User navigates to a facility with several allocated borrowers
       Then The facility shows 4 borrower tags
       And The allocated borrower count is "4"
       When User clicks "Select" button or ctrl+click
       Then Two borrowers are selected
       And Both borrowers are highlighted or checked indicating they are selected
       When User selects two borrowers "Delete" or "Remove" button becomes active
       And User clicks "Delete" or "Remove" button
       Then A confirmation prompt may appear
       When User confirms the deletion
       Then The two selected borrowers are removed from the facility
       And Tags for remaining two borrowers are still visible
       And The allocated borrower count is updates from "4" to "2" 


